  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Spirit of the Hare\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Spirit-of-the-hare.png\" title=\"Image:Spirit-of-the-hare.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Spirit-of-the-hare.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Spirit-of-the-hare.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Self Buff\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Increases Movement Speed\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Increases your movement rate by a phenomenal amount, allowing you to cover much ground.<br/>\nHowever, your ability to run through crowds of monsters is decreased and this skill has a 25% chance of being interrupted if the caster is successfully attacked.\n</p><p>In practice though, a player is generally moving fast enough to deke and dodge through and around the crowds of monsters, making this an excellent skill for running a dungeon.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Cool Down:</b> 90 seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Increases your movment speed by X % for Y seconds.</b><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 27\n</td><td> 51\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">X\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 70\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Y\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 70\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Mana\n</td><td> 13.6\n</td><td> 42.8\n</td><td> 72.0\n</td><td> 101.1\n</td><td> 130.3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 4176\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
